<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-LIPPO BANK SAYS FIRST HALF NET UP.</title>
<headline>TABLE-LIPPO BANK SAYS FIRST HALF NET UP.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		(in billion rupiah except per share numbers)</p>
<p>    Net interest income	  264.61	  vs  210.28</p>
<p>    Other operating income     65.56	   vs   46.65</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		 124.01	  vs   78.93</p>
<p>    Net profit			87.19	  vs   54.90</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rph)    203	    vs    192</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	    378.57	  vs  275.19</p>
<p>NOTE: The results were unaudited. PT Lippo Bank is a member of the Lippo Group conglomerate.</p>
